# S334: the * splat here 301'd every sub-path of the two legacy app trees into a
# 404 — /solara/assets/*.js (the Solara SPA bundle, still loaded by
# /solara/404.html) and the whole 30-file /franchise-architect/ build. A splat
# is only safe when a counterpart exists under the destination, and it did not.
# Retired ROUTES are now listed one by one; the app trees serve themselves.
