# S334: sitemap.html was a tracked, deployed, byte-drifted duplicate of
# /sitemap-page/ with zero inbound links — allowlisted in the orphan gate rather
# than removed. The file is gone; this keeps external bookmarks working.
/sitemap.html                                   /sitemap-page/                                     301

